[00:23.02]As we encourage one another
[00:27.68]To serve Jehovah faithfully,
[00:34.72]We find the bonds of love are strengthened;
[00:41.94]Fine works bring peace and unity.
[00:48.46]The love we find among God’s people
[00:53.33]Gives each the courage to endure.
[01:01.40]Our congregation is a refuge,
[01:07.80]A place where we can feel secure.
[01:13.96]A word when spoken at the right time
[01:24.86]Is, oh, how comforting to hear!
[01:31.80]We hear these words of consolation
[01:37.33]From friends so faithful and so dear.
[01:45.20]How good it is to work together
[01:51.62]With those whose hopes and goals we share!
[01:58.08]We seek to strengthen one another
[02:04.70]And help each one his burden bear.
[02:49.06]As we with eyes of faith are seeing
[02:53.12]The nearness of Jehovah’s day,
[03:00.90]We need our gathering together
[03:07.90]To keep us walking in the way.
[03:14.34]United with Jehovah’s people,
[03:20.78]We hope to serve eternally.
[03:27.24]So we encourage one another
[03:32.96]To hold to our integrity.
